{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dweller is a slow-burning, first-person psychological walk-sim horror experience set in the decaying sewer systems beneath an abandoned city. Descend into darkness and confront the horrors that have taken root below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive, slow-burning terror with survival-inspired elements that keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark, twisted sewer network and piece together secrets through eerie radio conversations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares, just relentless dread and deadly encounters. The deeper you go, the more your senses fail, your gear falters, your mind fractures\u2026 and terrifying enemies close in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different endings, choose yours...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/58c0afb73e1878f1ea7a0fe50cbc3924.avif?t=1757093679\" width=616 height=162 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been sent into the sewers to locate the source of a massive leak flooding the city above. Normally, a full crew would handle a job this dangerous, but with resources stretched thin, you are the only one left to respond. Armed with nothing but a dim headlamp and a crackling radio, you descend into the twisting tunnels. There are no reliable maps, no backup, only endless pipes and the weight of silence pressing in around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the radio stirs to life. A voice calls out, speaking as if it knows you. Its tone carries something else, something that makes you question whether it is here to guide you or lure you deeper.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2871090?t=1757093679","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/b7038ab609b9a21e3e4986ac8455741b95d8a02d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757093679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/f93c6ed913b412b1926e44bc10d8ec38585db741/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757093679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/f93c6ed913b412b1926e44bc10d8ec38585db741/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757093679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains mild violence, blood, and horror themes. It includes disturbing imagery, psychological horror, gore, and intense scenes that may be unsettling to some players."},"demos":[{"appid":3893540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dweller is a slow-burning, first-person psychological walk-sim horror experience set in the decaying sewer systems beneath an abandoned city. Descend into darkness and confront the horrors that have taken root below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive, slow-burning terror with survival-inspired elements that keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark, twisted sewer network and piece together secrets through eerie radio conversations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares, just relentless dread and deadly encounters. The deeper you go, the more your senses fail, your gear falters, your mind fractures\u2026 and terrifying enemies close in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different endings, choose yours...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/58c0afb73e1878f1ea7a0fe50cbc3924.avif?t=1757093679\" width=616 height=162 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been sent into the sewers to locate the source of a massive leak flooding the city above. Normally, a full crew would handle a job this dangerous, but with resources stretched thin, you are the only one left to respond. Armed with nothing but a dim headlamp and a crackling radio, you descend into the twisting tunnels. There are no reliable maps, no backup, only endless pipes and the weight of silence pressing in around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the radio stirs to life. A voice calls out, speaking as if it knows you. Its tone carries something else, something that makes you question whether it is here to guide you or lure you deeper.</p>","developers":["Alex Le Mesurier"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/b5380ceed7dfbfbf31f1c2a357c6deab7179a834/header.jpg?t=1757093679","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191420,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191420/movie480.mp4?t=1756722316","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191420/movie_max.mp4?t=1756722316"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191420/c584cebd02286f753d279fefbda7070e52920